    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight BPE approximation: tokens ≈ chars / divisor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The default divisor of 4 is empirically well-calibrated for English mixed-case prose and code. Increase to 3 for languages with many multi-byte characters; decrease to 5 for very short technical strings. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
